{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46903","headline":"道林寺居寄岳麓禅师二首 一 · 齐己","name":"道林寺居寄岳麓禅师二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前石路彻中峰，树影泉声在半空。\n寻去未应劳上下，往来殊已倦西东。\n髭根尽白孤云并，心迹全忘片月同。\n长忆高窗夏天里，古松青桧午时风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}